message:
`wirken update` rolled back or downgraded the installed binary.

Detection: downgrade_or_rollback (13)
Severity baseline: medium

@wirken.event.rollback true is `wirken update --rollback`; @install.version_delta below zero is a to_version lower than from_version (`--allow-downgrade`). A downgrade can reinstate fixed vulnerabilities. Pivot on host, @wirken.event.from_version, @wirken.event.to_version, @wirken.event.binary_sha256, @wirken.event.verifying_key.

Requires audit schema 2.3.0, the default binary_installed forwarding, and the @install.version_delta pipeline attribute (see datadog/README.md).

@security-team
